# ----- CodeTrack root environment -----
# The API is configured in server/.env (copy server/.env.example → server/.env
# and fill in real values there). This file is a pointer for convenience:
#
#   1. cp server/.env.example server/.env
#   2. set MONGODB_URI  (your MongoDB Atlas connection string)
#   3. set JWT_SECRET   (long random string; the server exits without it)
#
# The frontend needs no environment variables in development — see
# client/.env.example for the optional production overrides (VITE_API_URL).
#
# NEVER commit real .env files to Git (already covered by .gitignore).
